Description: SuperMox Manager - native desktop cluster management
 A standalone GTK application for SuperMox-compatible virtualization servers.
 Native screens provide cluster overview, searchable guest inventory, power
 actions, migration, snapshots, backups and task logs over the HTTPS API.
 The full server interface is available in an optional embedded WebKit window
 for advanced operations. No virtualization server is needed on the desktop.
 Credentials are kept in memory; native API connections pin the node's TLS
 certificate before sending credentials. Only display preferences are saved.
